>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `CS_CLARIFY_STEP_TAC`

``` hol4
classicalLib.CS_CLARIFY_STEP_TAC :
  clasetLib.claset -> NTactical.ntactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Constructs the claset-explicit form of `CLARIFY_STEP_TAC`.

`CS_CLARIFY_STEP_TAC cs` performs one non-branching safe or clarifying
step. It takes `cs` directly, exposes every result, and does not process
theorem-list markers.

### Failure

Produces no result when no clarifying step applies.

